feat(insightai): image-grounded search + follow-up chat

Adds a vision-powered InsightAI mode where the user attaches a photo
(camera or gallery), gets an LLM-grounded answer, and can chase the
conversation with follow-up questions. The image is re-attached on
every turn so mid-chat provider/mode switches stay accurate without
a session-aware backend.

Core
- image_pipeline.dart: pure-Dart isolate-safe compress + thumbnail
  pipeline. Caps long edge, EXIF-strips, JPEG-encodes, returns the
  bytes destined for the wire layer (base64 wrapped at the API client).
- image_search_store.dart: in-memory + Drift-backed store mirroring
  saved_search_store, but keyed on the image bytes hash so retries and
  saved-search promote/demote semantics are stable across follow-ups.
- tutor_ai_service.dart: new imageSearch() and imageFollowUp() RPCs
  posting to /api/v1/ai/image-search and /api/v1/ai/image-followup.
  Wire body: {query, image (base64), imageMediaType, query/initial-
  Answer/question/history for follow-up, ...ModelHints}.
- saved_search_store.dart: extended save schema to carry imageBytes,
  imageMediaType, and an isImageGrounded flag so image sessions round
  trip through the same Save / restore plumbing as text sessions.
- Cross-device delete sync continues to apply to image entries via the
  existing tombstone path.

UI
- image_followup_sheet.dart: full-screen vision chat sheet with
  preview thumbnail pinned to header, scroll-to-latest, mid-chat
  provider/mode chip switcher, and the unified app_toast for save /
  remove / clear toasts.
- saved_search_detail_sheet.dart + saved_searches_sheet.dart:
  render image entries inline (thumbnail + truncated query), tap
  reopens the image-followup sheet with full chat history.
- tutor_screen.dart: new image-attach button on the InsightAI card,
  launches the picker, runs the pipeline, and routes the answer to
  image_followup_sheet.

Android plumbing
- AndroidManifest.xml: CAMERA, READ_MEDIA_IMAGES, READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_
  USER_SELECTED permissions (Android 13+ scoped + 14+ partial).
- FileProvider entry with ${applicationId}.fileprovider authority so
  image_picker camera capture works without legacy storage perms.
- res/xml/file_paths.xml: cache + files + external paths exposed for
  any future upload flow on the same authority.

Dependencies
- image: ^4.3.0 (pure-Dart, isolate-safe, used by image_pipeline).

Tests (157 passing locally)
- image_pipeline_test, image_search_store_test, image_followup_store_
  test, image_followup_sheet_model_switch_test.
- saved_search_image_grounded_test, saved_search_sync_deep_test,
  saved_search_detail_sheet_image_test, saved_searches_sheet_image_
  test.
- tutor_ai_service_image_routing_test (verifies provider/mode hints
  flow into image-search and image-followup wire bodies unchanged).
- saved_search_sync_e2e_test extended for image roundtrip + tombstone
  delete sync of image-grounded entries.

Note
- Backend routes /api/v1/ai/image-search and /api/v1/ai/image-followup
  are not yet implemented in the ainexus repo. Until they ship, the
  image attach button will surface a 4xx via the unified error toast.
  Server-side wire shape mirrors search/searchFollowUp + adds image
  (base64) and imageMediaType to the body.
